---

import GitHub from '../icons/GitHub.astro';
import LinkedIn from '../icons/LinkedIn.astro';
import Tailwind from '../icons/Tailwind.astro';

---

           
{
        <article class="pb-12">
           <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-x-4 justify-between items-center space-x-4">
       
            <div>
                <p class="text-md text-pretty mb-4">My name is <strong class="text-pink-500">Sandra Montero</strong>, and since creating my first websites on Blogspot at 13, I knew programming would be part of my life. With 2.5 years of experience as a <strong class="text-pink-500">Full Stack Developer</strong>, I specialize in backend with Laravel while also enjoying frontend development and learning new technologies.</p>
                <p class="text-md text-pretty mb-4">I’ve worked on <strong class="text-pink-500">e-commerce platforms, company projects, and personal apps</strong>. I enjoy facing challenges and trying new solutions.</p>
                <p class="text-md text-pretty mb-4">I’m seeking a full-time role as a Full Stack, Backend, or Frontend Developer where I can grow professionally, contribute value to the team, and take on new challenges. I’m committed, motivated, and <strong class="text-pink-500">ready to give my best to become a top-level developer.</strong></p>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-full mb-4 flex items-center justify-center">
                <div class="bg-pink-500 w-56 h-56 rounded-full">
                    <img
                        class="w-full h-full object-cover block rounded-full"
                        src="/images/foto_perfil.jpg"
                        alt="Sandra photo"
                    />
                </div>
                </div>
           </div>
        </article>

}
    


